357
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:35,130
所以...我们就这么逃家了吗
So -- So we're running away from home.

358
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:36,461
这么做没关系吗
I mean, I-I-is that okay?

359
00:11:36,580 --> 00:11:37,990
没关系  我们是跟三个成年人同住
Yes. We live with three adults.

360
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,861
我们就跟出租公寓楼的房东差不多
We're basically landlords in an apartment building.

361
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:40,522
我们就是《妙房东》
We're the Ropers!

362
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:44,361
对的  没错  我们想开去哪就开去哪
Yes! Yes! We could just drive and drive.

363
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:45,983
没错  我们辛苦了多年
Exactly! We've earned the right to

364
00:11:46,045 --> 00:11:47,540
空巢老人的生活是我们应得的
live the empty-nesters' life

365
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:48,381
哪怕现在巢里还孩满为患
even though we're still full-nesters.

366
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,141
天啊
Oh, my God!

367
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:51,930
你还记得那一瓶
Do you remember that bottle of wine

368
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:53,521
在海莉出生当晚我们特意留的那红酒吗
we put aside the night Haley was born?

369
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:55,090
记得  我们本来打算
Yes! We were gonna open it

370
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:56,781
在他们三个人搬走的那晚打开
the night all three of them moved out.

371
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:59,081
然后一起看我们因为他们
And watch one of the thousands of movies we missed

372
00:11:59,250 --> 00:12:01,051
生病或肚子饿
'cause they were sick or hungry

373
00:12:01,092 --> 00:12:02,661
或被玩具噎到而错过的无数电影
or choking on the head of a Power Ranger.

374
00:12:03,060 --> 00:12:06,101
我是个还没看过《末路狂花》的女人
I am a woman who has never seen "Thelma and Louise."

375
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:08,381
那是我唯一错过的哈维·凯特尔电影
That's the only Harvey Keitel movie I've missed!

376
00:12:08,620 --> 00:12:09,301
我们开去哪
Where are we going?

377
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:11,041
让上天为我们安排吧
Let's let the universe decide.

378
00:12:13,660 --> 00:12:17,540
"家人是你每天都收到的上天礼物"
"Family is a gift you receive every day."

379
00:12:19,100 --> 00:12:21,361
现在还有讽刺内容的签文了吗
So they're making sarcastic ones now?

380
00:12:23,577 --> 00:12:24,539
松鼠
Squirrel!

381
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:30,941
我们好像毁了某人的毕业典礼
I think we just ruined someone's graduation.

382
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,260
我肯定是睡著了
Ay! I must have fallen asleep.

383
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,440
不会吧
I don't see how.

384
00:12:36,450 --> 00:12:39,781
那药冒出来的气味可真是不同凡响啊
The fumes coming off of that potion are something else.

385
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,930
是啊  等用完了以后  别扔掉
Yes. When we're done with this, don't throw it out

386
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:44,680
只需一茶匙  我能清理干净整个泳池
because with a teaspoon, I can clean the swimming pool.

387
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:47,461
好了  曼尼需要我去车库找他
Okay, Manny needs to see me in the garage.

388
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,541
我很快回来
I will be right back.

389
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:49,850
但一定要快啊
Yeah, but come right back

390
00:12:49,860 --> 00:12:52,101
这东西不能用超过五分钟
because this cannot stay longer than five minutes.

391
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:55,490
就好奇一问  如果这东西
Oh, and just for fun, what would happen

392
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:58,481
用了比如说17分钟会怎么样啊
if it stayed on for, say, I don't know, 17?

393
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:00,341
人家说...
Well, they say that --

394
00:13:00,965 --> 00:13:01,673
惨了
Ay, no!

395
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,081
不要啊
No!

396
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:07,600
你用乔的宝贝披风来包这臭东西吗
You used Joe's cape for this smelly thing?

397
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:10,264
-你知道这东西对他多重要吗  -不知道
- You know how important this is for him? - No.

398
00:13:10,994 --> 00:13:13,870
心中重要度是从我  披风  巧克力碎饼干
It goes me, the cape, chocolate chip cookies,

399
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:14,781
再到杰
and then Jay!

400
00:13:14,980 --> 00:13:16,590
那我们能不能就说是杰搞的
Well, can't we just say Jay ruined it,

401
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,281
反正他已经在名单底层了
since he's already so far down the list?

402
00:13:18,540 --> 00:13:20,320
你们有人看到我的披风吗
Has anyone seen my cape?

403
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:22,041
没有  它长什么样
Uh, no. What's it look like?

404
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,701
披风样啊
Like a cape!

405
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:26,741
对不起  没了它我好抓狂
Sorry. It's just so stressful.

406
00:13:27,980 --> 00:13:29,201
这样吧  我先去帮曼尼
You know what? I have to go to Manny.

407
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:31,310
然后洗乔的披风  再回来找你
Then I'll clean Joe's cape. Then I'll be back.

408
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,161
没事  去吧
It's okay. Go.

409
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:35,640
我们会在度假胜地坎昆这里等你
We will all be waiting for you here in Cancun.

410
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:42,281
有哪里出了问题  到处都是油
Something's wrong. There's oil everywhere!

411
00:13:42,511 --> 00:13:44,321
估计只需要弄紧放油塞就行了
Well, you probably just need to tighten the drain plug.

412
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:48,801
你戳爆了她轮胎吗
You popped her tire?!

413
00:13:48,940 --> 00:13:50,601
没事  没关系的
It's okay. It's all right.

414
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,502
杰都把补胎工具收哪了
Where does Jay keep his patch kit?

415
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:54,501
我花了20分钟才找到这里灯的开关
It took 20 minutes to find the light switch.

416
00:13:54,540 --> 00:13:55,740
我能知道补胎工具在哪吗
I'm gonna know where a patch kit is?

417
00:13:55,750 --> 00:13:57,921
别恐慌  我之前有在这里看到
Don't panic. I saw one here earlier.

418
00:14:00,734 --> 00:14:00,861
找到啦
Here it is.

419
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,488
-别啊  别  -干嘛
- Oh, no! No! - What?

420
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:04,021
那是乔的披风
That's Joe's cape!

421
00:14:04,620 --> 00:14:05,441
不是吧
Oh, no!

422
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:07,281
这是乔最爱的东西了
Joe loves this cape more than anything.

423
00:14:07,380 --> 00:14:09,391
心中重要度顺序是我  披风  巧克力碎饼干
It goes me, the cape, chocolate chip cookies --

424
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:10,022
要好了吗  曼尼
Almost done, Manny?

425
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:11,161
你来啦
Oh, hey.

426
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:13,430
其实早能好了  都是被我拖延进度
Yeah, well, he would be if I wasn't out here

427
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,500
回答了我一堆问题  比如说...
asking him so many questions about, you know,

428
00:14:15,510 --> 00:14:17,880
怎么补车胎之类的  但就像他说的
how to -- how to patch a tire, but like he said,

429
00:14:17,890 --> 00:14:19,413
补车胎的方法全都清楚写在
the directions are written clearly down

430
00:14:19,434 --> 00:14:20,320
补胎工具包里了
inside the patch kit.

431
00:14:20,330 --> 00:14:21,981
就算真的很棘手
And then if you get in a real jam,

432
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,813
网上也有无数教学影片啊
there's tons of videos online, anyway.

433
00:14:24,290 --> 00:14:25,051
我们给他一点工作空间吧
Shouldn't we give him some space?

434
00:14:25,061 --> 00:14:26,281
比如我们可以去喝杯茶
Maybe get some -- some tea?

435
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:31,501
春季舞会有舞伴了吗
So, do you have a date for spring formal?

436
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:34,181
我估计都不会去吧  我没合适的服装
I probably won't even go. I have nothing to wear.

437
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,801
天啊  天啊
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

438
00:14:37,820 --> 00:14:39,341
也没这么严重啦
It's not that big of a deal.

439
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:40,821
世上还有人没饭吃呢
I mean, people are starving.

440
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,680
这不是什么迹象[指示牌]吧
This isn't a sign, is it?

441
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:51,299
绝对不是结实的指示牌  毕竟是五年级生搭的
Well, it's not a sturdy one, but they're only fifth-graders.

442
00:14:52,060 --> 00:14:53,701
不是啦  我是说不该逃离家里的迹象
No! No, that we shouldn't have run away!

443
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:56,390
才不是  我们把这个绑好就能继续上路
No. We're just gonna tie this off, hit the open road,

444
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:57,375
一直开  开到冲马桶时
and keep driving until the toilets flush

445
00:14:58,060 --> 00:14:58,801
漩涡旋转方向相反之地[南半球]
in the other direction.

446
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,881
天啊  要飘走了
Oh, God! Oh, no! It's floating away!

447
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,161
没事
Oh! Oh, okay!

448
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:03,542
卡在树上了  我们能拉回来
It's caught in the tree, we can reach it.

449
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:04,527
-上我肩膀  -什么
- Get on my shoulders! - What?

450
00:15:05,060 --> 00:15:07,094
是啊  对的
Right! Oh, yeah, right. Oh!

451
00:15:07,115 --> 00:15:07,861
对哦  我都忘了这招
Okay, I forgot about that.

452
00:15:07,940 --> 00:15:08,583
等等  往前进
Oh, wait. Go forward!

453
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,001
太高了
It's too high!

454
00:15:10,060 --> 00:15:12,341
抓那个线就行了  你是在抓那个线吗
Just reach for the string! Are you reaching for the string?

455
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:14,461
不是  我在假装看演唱会
No, I'm pretending I'm at a Def Leppard concert!

456
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:16,130
就在那里  你抓啊
It's right there! Just grab it!

457
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,481
我够不到  菲尔
I can't reach it, Phil!

458
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:19,141
我够不到"人生下一章"
I can't reach "The Next Chapter!"

459
00:15:19,740 --> 00:15:21,262
我的天啊  放我下来  放我下来吧
Oh, my God. Let me down. Let me down.

460
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:22,142
-怎么了  -放我下来
- What? - Let me down.

461
00:15:22,160 --> 00:15:22,562
怎么啦
What?

462
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:25,821
你没看出上天给我们的旨意吗
Don't you see what the universe is trying to tell us?

463
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,061
我们永远也到不了"人生下一章"
We are never gonna reach the next chapter.

464
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,881
卢克不会去上大学
Luke's not going to college.

465
00:15:30,140 --> 00:15:31,821
海莉会在我们地下室住到老
Haley's gonna grow old in the basement.

466
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:34,590
艾丽克斯只会一直回来嘲讽我们
Alex is just gonna keep coming back to taunt us

467
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,961
然后用完我们的纸巾
and use up our tissues!

468
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:38,201
我觉得老天爷没对我们那么"关照"吧
I don't think the universe cares that much about us.

469
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:40,160
菲尔  我们想逃跑
Phil, we tried to run away,

470
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:42,321
但我从这里都还看得到我们家烟囱
and I can still see our chimney from here.

471
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:43,361
放弃吧
It's over.

472
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:46,121
好的  够了
Oh, yeah. This is it.

473
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:49,334
"欢迎来到
"Welcome...

474
00:15:49,577 --> 00:15:51,160
我们的人生"
to our life!"

475
00:15:52,940 --> 00:15:54,830
宝贝  我跟你一样不开心
Sweetheart, I-I am as upset as you are,

476
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:57,501
但事情本来就从未按我们计划的来过啊
but since when did anything work out the way we planned?

477
00:15:58,300 --> 00:16:00,080
我们没计划过生海莉
We didn't plan on having Haley.

478
00:16:00,180 --> 00:16:01,561
也没计划再生艾丽克斯
We didn't plan on having Alex.

479
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:03,220
我们的确是计划过生卢克
We did plan on having Luke,

480
00:16:03,230 --> 00:16:04,601
但没计划过生出"卢克"这样的
but we didn't plan on having Luke.

481
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:08,761
我在闹脾气  但我也爱我们的孩子  真的
I'm having a tantrum. And I love our kids, I do.

482
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:10,041
大多数时候  我真的爱
Most of the time, I do.

483
00:16:10,220 --> 00:16:11,138
只是在我心里
It's just I had this --

484
00:16:11,994 --> 00:16:14,681
我有过对我们这阶段人生的憧憬
this picture of how our life would look right now.

485
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:18,041
不是现在这样子
This is not that.

486
00:16:18,300 --> 00:16:18,762
完全不是
No.

487
00:16:19,140 --> 00:16:19,562
是啊
Yeah.

488
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:21,881
我懂
I get it. 

489
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:24,870
或许...
Maybe...

490
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:26,321
或许我们不用放弃那憧憬
Maybe we don't have throw away the picture.

491
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:29,460
重新调整一下就行了
Just refocus it a little.

492
00:16:40,027 --> 00:16:41,450
轮爪螺母  撬胎棒
Lug nut. Tire iron.

493
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:42,121
格尔锤  鸽子门
Flugel hammer. Pigeon door.

494
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:43,700
这些词对我而言都是火星话
These are all nonsense words to me.

495
00:16:43,710 --> 00:16:44,661
我都不知道我在这里干什么
I don't know what I'm doing here.

496
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,601
是啊  我也不知道我在这里干嘛啊
Yeah, well, I don't know what I'm doing here, either.

497
00:16:46,700 --> 00:16:49,050
难道我就真的连独处一晚都不行
Am I so incapable of spending a night alone

498
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:51,541
还得跑来你家制造这么多麻烦吗
that I had to come over here and create all this drama?

499
00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:54,601
难怪米奇尔想逃离我
No wonder Mitchell wanted to get away from me.

500
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:55,402
你们好了吗
Hello?

501
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,550
谢谢你啊  曼尼
Oh! Hey, well, thank you, Manny,

502
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:59,721
给我一个把最后的螺母拧紧的机会
for letting me tighten that last wheel screw.

503
00:17:00,180 --> 00:17:02,501
或许下周你可以教我怎么街头式出拳
Maybe next week you could teach me how to street punch?

504
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:03,561
可以啊  没问题
Yeah. Sure!

505
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:07,461
小卡在楼上帮我找到的
Cam found it upstairs for me.

506
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:10,101
这件是你妈妈的裙子  是不是很怪啊
It's one of your mom's dresses. Isn't that crazy?

507
00:17:10,180 --> 00:17:11,781
跟心理医生聊两句就没事了
I can see running it by a therapist.

508
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,961
看起来车好像弄好了
So, car looks done.

509
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:16,371
你有兴趣去...  比如说
Do you maybe want to, I don't know,

510
00:17:16,381 --> 00:17:17,341
一起吃个东西之类的吗
go get something to eat?

511
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:20,120
没问题啊  但我身上有点脏
Uh, sure! But I'm a little dirty.

512
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:22,200
那又如何  挺可爱的啊
So? It's cute.

513
00:17:28,320 --> 00:17:29,781
聊聊吗
A word?

514
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:32,861
你看
See?

515
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:35,386
就跟新...
Good as --

516
00:17:35,692 --> 00:17:36,120
天啊
No! Oh.

517
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:39,175
看起来像被怪兽啃过
It looks like a monster ate it!

518
00:17:40,140 --> 00:17:40,801
没错
Exactly.

519
00:17:41,340 --> 00:17:43,001
你看  这代表你很有故事
See? It tells a story.

520
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:46,541
这是你跟恶龙大战时被它吐火烧的
This burn is from when you fought a dragon!

521
00:17:47,578 --> 00:17:48,301
而这些油污呢
A-And these oil stains?

522
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:49,910
是在你拯救要掉下桥的
Well, they're from when you saved that 18-wheeler

523
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:51,181
加长大卡车时沾到的
from going off a bridge.

524
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:54,500
这是个超级英雄的披风
This is the cape of a superhero

525
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:58,321
他永远在人们需要时出现
who's always there for people in need.

526
00:18:00,874 --> 00:18:02,010
飞走吧
Fly away!

527
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:03,780
你说得真好  小卡
That was so nice, Cam.

528
00:18:04,548 --> 00:18:06,130
谢谢  你看起来好多了
Thanks. You look better.

529
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:07,621
你的烧也退了
And your fever's gone.

530
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:10,421
我不知道你在我外婆的药里加了什么
I don't know what you put in my abuela's potion,

531
00:18:10,540 --> 00:18:13,381
但这次烧退得比以前任何一次都快
but it took care of the fever faster than ever.

532
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:16,501
你看  甚至还让我的牙变白了
Look! It even made my teeth whiter, huh?

533
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:18,090
你看看
Oh! Wow. Look at that.

534
00:18:18,100 --> 00:18:20,870
我本来还在怨自己独处不了
Here I was beating myself up because I couldn't be alone,

535
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:23,790
但或许有人会觉得这个家里的所有人
and one could argue that everybody in this house

536
00:18:23,800 --> 00:18:25,721
因为我的毛病而得到了好处
is a little better off because of it.

537
00:18:25,860 --> 00:18:28,810
我损失了一条裙子  家里一股烧焦味
Well, I lost a dress and the house smells like smoke,

538
00:18:28,820 --> 00:18:32,000
如果是我  我也不会过分自豪
so I wouldn't be high-fiving myself that much.

539
00:18:49,205 --> 00:18:50,062
有事吗  先生
Ah, yes, sir?

540
00:18:52,783 --> 00:18:53,650
对吧
Right?

541
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:57,221
没人可以把我的心悬在半空500页
Nobody keeps me on edge for 500 pages

542
00:18:57,420 --> 00:18:58,981
然后故事说结束就结束
then decides they're just done writing.

543
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:01,781
你要么好好收尾  要么就根本别开始写
Either end the damn story or don't even write it!

544
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:02,801
对啊  就是嘛
Yes, exactly.

545
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:04,821
天啊  我还一度以为我哪里漏读[错过]了
God, for a minute, I thought I missed something.

546
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:05,542
是啊
You did.

547
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:08,361
你错过了你独处的夜晚读到一本好书的机会
The chance to read a great book on your one night alone.

548
00:19:09,060 --> 00:19:11,161
至少牛排还蛮好吃的  对吧
Well, at least the steak was good, right?

549
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:13,501
肉的部位好  烹调得更好
Nice cut. Perfectly cooked.

550
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:14,382
酒也好喝
Terrific wine.

551
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:16,921
怎么  怎么  哪里好笑了
What? What's -- What's funny?

552
00:19:17,220 --> 00:19:17,583
你啊
You.

553
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:20,421
牛排  书  这整段旅程
The steak, the book, hell, this whole trip.

554
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,981
你在变成我
You're turning into me!

555
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:23,081
没  才没有
No. No. Unh-unh.

556
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:25,930
才不是呢  爸  不不不
No, no, no. Dad. No, no.

557
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:27,401
是你在变成我
Hey. You're turning into me.

558
00:19:27,420 --> 00:19:27,902
怎么说
How?

559
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:30,201
你居然能坚持把那本书看完
The fact that you stayed with that book at all,

560
00:19:30,220 --> 00:19:32,561
这基本上就是两个男人的爱情故事
which is basically a love story between two men.

561
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,561
是兄弟情好吗
It's a buddy thing!

562
00:19:33,780 --> 00:19:34,581
你少来了
Oh, please!

563
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:36,470
兄弟才不会找那么多机会
Buddies don't find that many opportunities

564
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:37,731
一起裸泳呢
to skinny-dip together.

565
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:39,721
每次只要他们一到水边
Every time they saw a body of water,

566
00:19:39,780 --> 00:19:41,322
他们就脱裤子  跳进水里
it was off with the pants, splash!

567
00:19:41,340 --> 00:19:42,501
拜托  别再把那书说得更恶心了
Come on. You're just making it worse.

568
00:19:42,660 --> 00:19:44,281
天啊  你的手
Oh, my God! Your hands!

569
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:46,081
原来你预约水疗是为了这个
That's what your spa appointment was.

570
00:19:46,140 --> 00:19:47,061
你去做了美甲
You got a manicure.

571
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,622
我去做是因为歌洛莉亚说我的手太粗糙
It's because Gloria said that my hands were too rough.

572
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:50,661
是她的主意
It was her idea.

573
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:52,561
体贴  我的风格
Considerate -- That's me.

574
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:55,081
逃离家人  我的风格
Running from your family -- That's me.

575
00:19:58,940 --> 00:20:00,122
是啦  是啦
Yeah, yeah.

576
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:03,830
或许有可能是
Ah, I guess it's possible

577
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:07,940
我们两个都往彼此的中间移动了一点
that we both moved to the center a little.

578
00:20:08,180 --> 00:20:09,781
是啦  挺有道理的
Yeah, well, it makes sense.

579
00:20:10,580 --> 00:20:12,861
这样也让我们相处容易许多
It definitely makes things easier between us.

580
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,121
也少了点距离感
A little less distance.

581
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:16,002
是啊
Yeah.

582
00:20:16,012 --> 00:20:16,556
是啦
Yeah.

583
00:20:16,700 --> 00:20:18,731
我有一个...
Uh, hey, um... here's a --

584
00:20:18,740 --> 00:20:19,401
有个疯狂的想法
It's a crazy thought.

585
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:21,930
有一件  有一件我们过去的自己
There's -- There's something old us could never do

586
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:24,370
不飙泪不骂人就做不到
without tears and screaming

587
00:20:24,380 --> 00:20:26,981
但我觉得新的彼此可以做到的事
that I think new us might be able to handle.

588
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:30,481
这可以帮我在家里提升地位  如果你愿意帮的话
It might help me out at home, you know, if -- if you're game.

589
00:20:32,180 --> 00:20:33,641
以手肘带动
Lead with your elbow.

590
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,721
转移你的重心
Shift your weight.

591
00:20:36,760 --> 00:20:37,581
把球投出
Follow through.

592
00:20:39,198 --> 00:20:39,601
不差
That's not bad.

593
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:41,090
但也不好  不过好歹我没在哭
No, it wasn't good, but I'm not crying

594
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:42,901
你也还没开始叫我"小姐"  继续吧
and you haven't called me "Missy", so let's keep going.

595
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,261
他们没得选了
They had no choice.

596
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:05,361
钩子上放了饵食就会亮红灯
The light turns red when you put something on it,

597
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,301
当饵食没了就会亮绿灯
green when the hook is free.

598
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:10,041
-我把它成为智能神钩  -太神了
- I call it a Smart Hook. - So smart.

599
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:12,081
这主意是我在室内停车场时受到启发
I got the idea... when I was in a parking garage.

600
00:21:12,420 --> 00:21:13,680
-你知道他们的指示灯...  -天啊  爸  别回头看
- You know those little lights... - Oh, God, Dad. No, don't look.

601
00:21:13,701 --> 00:21:15,241
-别看  -他们在这里干嘛
- Don't look. - What are they doing here?

602
00:21:15,493 --> 00:21:16,881
他们不会想跟我们一起共进早午餐吧
They're not gonna want to have brunch with us, are they?

603
00:21:16,891 --> 00:21:18,581
不可以  这是我们的日子
They can't! This is our day!

604
00:21:19,160 --> 00:21:20,241
你觉得他们有看到我们吗
You think they see us?

605
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:23,141
继续走就对了
Just keep walking.

606
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:24,141
不要有突然的大动作
No sudden movements.

607
00:21:24,320 --> 00:21:26,961
地图上写著这里还有另一家咖啡厅
The site maps say there's another cafe...

608
00:21:27,560 --> 00:21:29,281
-我的书  -别捡了
- My book. - Leave it!
